時策已平吳、會二郡，賁與策征廬江太守劉勳、江夏太守黃祖，軍旋，聞繇病死，過定豫章，上賁領太守，後封都亭侯。建安十三年，使者劉隱奉詔拜賁為征虜將軍，領郡如故。在官十一年卒。子鄰嗣。","source_term":"子鄰嗣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu051-ben-3","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"8jx_b5c_t2q_AA","label":"孫苗","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"苗","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0202","c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0205"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-ben","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0202","quote":"苗"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-ben","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0205","quote":"苗"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q_A","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-ben","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034","quote":"　　鄰年九歲，代領豫章，近封都鄉侯。在郡垂二十年，討平叛賊，功績修理。召還武昌，為繞帳督。時太常潘浚掌荊州事，重安長陳留舒燮有罪下獄，浚嘗失燮，欲置之於法。論者多為有言，浚猶不釋。鄰謂浚曰：\"舒伯膺兄弟爭死，海內義之，以為美談，仲膺又奉國舊意。今君殺其子弟，若天下一統，青蓋北巡，中州士人必問仲膺繼嗣，答者雲潘承明殺燮，於事何如?\"浚意即解，燮用得濟。鄰遷夏口沔中督、威遠將軍，所居任職。赤烏十二年卒。子苗嗣。苗弟旅及叔父安、熙、績，皆歷列位。","source_term":"子苗嗣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu051-ben-5","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"lyi_4sa_ssv","label":"孫旅","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"旅","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0207"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-ben","pa